Beayam
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 46 ROTATE 3 U U
COLUMN 9 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 9 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 2 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 4 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 7 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL

LEBO 7 FACE_LAST
LEBO 2 FACE_LAST
LEBO 2 FACE_LAST
LEBO 0 FACE_LAST
LEBO 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
LEBO 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK LEBO COLUMN
DESTSRC Rank equal
MOVE_STACK LEBO LEBO
OR
    DEST Empty
    SRCSTACK Rank descending
$win
PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
